      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mentoring.webp",
            text: _("This land is cursed. Liches have existed here for ages, luring adventurers and soldiers to their deaths and amassing great armies and fortunes."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-human-concerned.webp",
            text: _("Look there! The swamp is infested with all manner of skeletons, corpses, and worse. I hope I have made a wise choice in taking this path."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("These Death Knights appear to be minions enslaved by the Lich-Lord. This one must be particularly powerful, since Death Knights are usually strong-willed spirits on their own."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("I believe we can destroy the master and release the minions. There is much fighting to be done before we can pass through these swamps in peace. May our bones not join these fallen warriors who now oppose us."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_18_opt0",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:apply_object",
            object: "%7B%22id%22%3A%22void_armor%22%2C%22effects%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22abilities%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
